requestBody.description:
Optional filtering to apply to the visual search.

<br>Example multi-modal search that limits results to assets in folders IDs 1 and 2, that have "copper" in path, folder, or metadata and are in stock.
```
{
  "searchQuery": "copper",
  "filters": {
    "folders": ["my/folder", "your/folder"],
    "metadata": {
      "inStock": true
    }
  }
}
```

